While I was shooting an event for the hair company Pureology in NYC at the Trump Soho, I was given some extra time with the stylists and models from their show to do a little 20 minute impromptu shoot. So as soon as they were done off the stage, we ran outside for a quick shoot out in the windy summer day. When I was done with the stills on my Nikon, I grabbed a minute of video footage with the Canon 7D I had in my bag and shot it at 60FPS. Loved the results.